/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 106 0 R
/T (The HostelDB database contains 12 tables that manage student accommodation and hostel services. The Students, Hostels, Rooms, and Beds tables handle basic accommodation information, while Allocations connects students with their assigned beds. Payments manages fee records, and Complaints and MaintenanceRequests track student issues. The Services and ServiceRequests tables manage student services, while Staff and Visitors maintain hostel staff and visitor information. Together, these related tables provide a centralized and organized system for hostel management.)
/E (The HostelDB database contains 12 tables that manage student accommodation and hostel services. The Students, Hostels, Rooms, and Beds tables handle basic accommodation information, while Allocations connects students with their assigned beds. Payments manages fee records, and Complaints and MaintenanceRequests track student issues. The Services and ServiceRequests tables manage student services, while Staff and Visitors maintain hostel staff and visitor information. Together, these related tables provide a centralized and organized system for hostel management.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
